{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "836d9268-ee1e-86b9-95db-900353f6920e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T11:18:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonella DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:16:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hi. Sorry, I'm on speaker and I'm actually in my bathroom, because it's the only place in the house I get decent reception. So if there's an echo, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:16:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:16:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so there's a streetlight by my house that is on all day. Like, right now. It's eleven in the morning and it's glowing away. It's been like that for a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:17:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a streetlight that's staying on during the daytime. What's the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's two hundred Gidley Street. In the Fifth Ward. The pole is right out front, by the edge of my yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two hundred Gidley. Is there a number on the pole, a little tag or sticker, by chance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:17:21-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I didn't look. Oh, wait, hang on, I can't exactly go check, I'm mid, never mind. Oh, and by the way, the one across the street flickers at night too, but that's kind of a different thing. Anyway, the day one. Can you just send somebody to look at the pole? Because it's wasting electricity and it's honestly kind of dumb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:17:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'll put in a request for a crew to check the pole. I'll note the flickering one across the street too, so they look at both while they're out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:17:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks. I mean, it'd be nice if it just got fixed the first time someone noticed, but fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:18:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Can I get a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:18:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's four zero one, five five five, zero one five nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:18:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four zero one, five five five, zero one five nine. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:18:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Antonella DeLuca. Two L's in DeLuca, no, sorry, just one L. D-E-L-U-C-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:18:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Antonella DeLuca. It's in the system. Light staying on all day, plus a flicker across the street. Crews are doing lights as they can this week with the holiday coming, so it may take a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:18:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. Okay. It's been on for a few days already, but okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:18:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:18:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T11:18:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now. Happy holidays."
    }
  ],
